  dialogue:
  - Our test dialogue for the script
  - 1 2 3 4 5 6!?
  - "I\u2019ve been reading through some of the museum\u2019s digital collection\u2013or,
    gallery, I guess. \r\n(KQA)"
  - "I read comics the most, and it\u2019s pretty fun to see how the characters and
    setting change over time. \r\n(KQA) "
  - 'Like the detective Plainclothes Paige, who starts off in a fairly normal setting,

    (KQA)'
  - "but in stories decades later, travels to the moon and meets aliens! \r\n(KQA)\n"
  - "There is a physical comics exhibit down the hall from here! \n(A1) "
  - "Some of the museum staff bring me booklets and flyers from other rooms, so I
    can see what\u2019s going on. \r\n(A1)\n"
  - "They taught me how to use the digital archives, but I\u2019m not allowed to
    stay on there for too long. \r\n\n(a1)"
  - "(I think they\u2019re worried that looking at screens too much would be worse
    for me than a regular person, which makes sense.) \r\n\n(A1)"
